      <div class="t pt l" id="t-k02" style="left:50%;top:57%">Time goes to manual effort and research: follow-ups, ticket updates, admin work, finding and updating documentation</div>
      <div class="t pt l" id="t-k10" style="left:50%;top:37%">Thorough, and difficult to navigate for quick answers</div>
      <div class="t pt l" id="t-k11" style="left:50%;top:47%">Takes a lot to build, a lot to maintain, and goes stale when it isn't</div>
      <div class="t pt l" id="t-k12" style="left:50%;top:57%">Raised in every conversation, as a strength and a frustration for the team</div>
      <div class="t pt l" id="t-k20" style="left:50%;top:37%">Enable the job: tools that make people faster at what only they can do</div>
