      <div class="t pt l" id="t-k30" style="left:50%;top:37%">Growth: new and more efficient ways to go to market, and a top line above 30 percent</div>
      <div class="t pt l" id="t-k31" style="left:50%;top:47%">Cost: a lower cost to operate and iterate, from tech spend to limited hiring</div>
      <div class="t pt l" id="t-k32" style="left:50%;top:57%">Capacity: more of it across the current team, as the effect of both</div>
