      <div class="t sum l" id="t-m0" style="left:30%;top:72%"><b>Weeks 1 to 2</b>Map how knowledge is stored, used, and connected today. Rank the highest-value content for rebuild. Agree on the current state and priorities before anything is designed.</div>
